@startuml
title QuickDesk企业工单与SLA协作管理系统用例图

top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #F7FAFF
    BorderColor #3478C0
    ArrowColor #555555
}
skinparam actor {
    BorderColor #333333
    BackgroundColor white
}

actor "工单提交人" as Requester
actor "工单处理人" as Assignee
actor "管理员" as Admin

rectangle "QuickDesk企业工单与SLA协作管理系统" {

    usecase "登录、退出和\n修改本人密码" as UC_Account
    usecase "查看、搜索工单\n及SLA状态" as UC_Query
    usecase "创建工单并\n跟踪处理状态" as UC_CreateTrack

    usecase "查看分配工单、\n开始处理并完成工单" as UC_Handle
    usecase "申请转交工单" as UC_RequestTransfer
    usecase "DeepSeek故障处理助手\n与相似历史案例" as UC_ResolutionAI

    usecase "用户与账号管理" as UC_UserAdmin
    usecase "分派或重新分派工单" as UC_Assign
    usecase "审批转交申请" as UC_TransferApprove

    usecase "查询操作日志和\n查看数据仪表盘" as UC_Dashboard
    usecase "智能派单分析与\n转交辅助审核" as UC_AdminAI
    usecase "生成DeepSeek\n运营洞察" as UC_Insight

    UC_Account -[hidden]right- UC_Query
    UC_Query -[hidden]right- UC_CreateTrack

    UC_Handle -[hidden]right- UC_RequestTransfer
    UC_RequestTransfer -[hidden]right- UC_ResolutionAI

    UC_UserAdmin -[hidden]right- UC_Assign
    UC_Assign -[hidden]right- UC_TransferApprove

    UC_Dashboard -[hidden]right- UC_AdminAI
    UC_AdminAI -[hidden]right- UC_Insight

    UC_Account -[hidden]down- UC_Handle
    UC_Handle -[hidden]down- UC_UserAdmin
    UC_UserAdmin -[hidden]down- UC_Dashboard

    UC_Query -[hidden]down- UC_RequestTransfer
    UC_RequestTransfer -[hidden]down- UC_Assign
    UC_Assign -[hidden]down- UC_AdminAI

    UC_CreateTrack -[hidden]down- UC_ResolutionAI
    UC_ResolutionAI -[hidden]down- UC_TransferApprove
    UC_TransferApprove -[hidden]down- UC_Insight
}

Requester -right-> UC_Account
Requester -right-> UC_Query
Requester -right-> UC_CreateTrack

Assignee -right-> UC_Account
Assignee -right-> UC_Query
Assignee -right-> UC_Handle
Assignee -right-> UC_RequestTransfer
Assignee -right-> UC_ResolutionAI

Admin -left-> UC_Account
Admin -left-> UC_Query
Admin -left-> UC_UserAdmin
Admin -left-> UC_Assign
Admin -left-> UC_TransferApprove
Admin -left-> UC_Dashboard
Admin -left-> UC_AdminAI
Admin -left-> UC_Insight

UC_ResolutionAI .> UC_Handle : <<extend>>
UC_AdminAI .> UC_Assign : <<extend>>
UC_AdminAI .> UC_TransferApprove : <<extend>>
UC_Insight .> UC_Dashboard : <<extend>>

note bottom of UC_AdminAI
AI只提供辅助分析和候选建议。
分派及审批结果由管理员确认。
end note

note bottom of UC_ResolutionAI
处理人必须核实AI生成的方案，
AI不能自动修改或完成工单。
end note

@enduml